---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Prose from '@/components/Prose.astro';
import Button from '@/components/ui/Button.astro';
import hero from '@/assets/training/chair-yoga.jpg';

const registerUrl = 'https://SivanandaToronto.as.me/?appointmentType=18409110';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Chair Yoga Teacher Training"
  lead="Tools to teach chair yoga — helping students build strength, awareness and confidence."
  description="Chair Yoga Teacher Training at the Toronto Sivananda Yoga Vedanta Centre."
  heroImage={hero}
  heroAlt="Chair yoga teacher training"
  narrow
>
  <Prose>
    <p>
      Our society is ageing, and there are many people unable to practise a standard yoga class.
      This program offers you the tools to help your students build strength, awareness and
      confidence, and to increase their well-being both physically and mentally.
    </p>

    <h2>The program covers</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Teaching a 30–60 minute chair yoga class.</li>
      <li>Teaching a group living with Alzheimer's and other forms of dementia.</li>
      <li>Teaching a group with Multiple Sclerosis and other causes of limited mobility.</li>
      <li>Teaching chair yoga for office workers.</li>
      <li>Working with other common issues that make a chair necessary.</li>
      <li>How to set up the class and how to teach from a chair.</li>
      <li>Anatomy of aging; mental aspects of aging; yoga philosophy and aging.</li>
      <li>Meditation and mantras.</li>
      <li>Storytelling and other ways to share yogic philosophy.</li>
      <li>How to find work as a chair yoga instructor; volunteer opportunities.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <strong>Practicum:</strong> students have the opportunity to practise teaching. Course dates are
      announced through the year — please check upcoming events or contact us.
    </p>

    <h2>Your teacher</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Anjaneya (Michael Hutkins)</strong> is a yoga teacher and yoga therapist who has trained
      in various Sivananda ashrams around the world. He shares yoga classes, trainings, and sees private
      clients regularly, and believes that everyone can benefit from this beautiful life practice.
    </p>
  </Prose>

  <div class="mt-8"><Button href={registerUrl} external>Register</Button></div>
</PageLayout>
